  data: {
    LLM: 'Be first to reach 101 or more points from tricks, singing (20/40), and last trick (10); or declare tute (four kings or four horses) after winning a trick to win immediately; or announce capote when stock is exhausted and take all eight remaining tricks to win (lose one trick and opponent wins).\n\nSame as Tute corriente except eight cards each instead of six. Non-dealer leads. Until stock exhausted: no follow suit or trump required; second player may play any card. Winner of trick draws from stock first, then opponent; face-up trump is last card drawn. After stock empty: must follow suit and beat if possible, trump if cannot follow. After winning a trick, may sing one 40 or 20; tute wins the game. When stock is exhausted, either player may announce capote and must then take all eight remaining tricks to win. Trump 7 or 2 may be exchanged for turned card. Wrong claim of 101+ loses.',
    Player: 'Be first to reach 101 or more points from tricks, singing (20/40), and last trick (10); or declare tute (four kings or four horses) after winning a trick to win immediately; or announce capote when stock is exhausted and take all eight remaining tricks to win (lose one trick and opponent wins).\n\nSame as Tute corriente except eight cards each instead of six. Non-dealer leads. Until stock exhausted: no follow suit or trump required; second player may play any card. Winner of trick draws from stock first, then opponent; face-up trump is last card drawn. After stock empty: must follow suit and beat if possible, trump if cannot follow. After winning a trick, may sing one 40 or 20; tute wins the game. When stock is exhausted, either player may announce capote and must then take all eight remaining tricks to win. Trump 7 or 2 may be exchanged for turned card. Wrong claim of 101+ loses.',
